SUMMARY:Craig Shoemaker The Love Master
LOCATION:The Stand Up Comedy Club\, Bellflower
DESCRIPTION:Five years of comedy deserves a birthday present with a punchli
 
ne---and Craig Shoemaker\, the Love Master is delivering it! Celebrate The 
 
Stand Up Comedy Club's 5th Anniversary with the Emmy-winning comedian\, act
 
or\, and master storyteller behind the legendary \, "rdquo" -> Lovemaster."
 
 With decades of stand-up under his belt\, Craig's razor-sharp observations
 
\, unforgettable characters\, and ridiculously relatable stories have made 
 
him a comedy favorite nationwide. It's a milestone night for the club\, so 
 
we're celebrating the only sensible way: packing the room and laughing unti
 
l somebody's mascara files for workers' comp. Five years. One legendary com
 
ic. Zero reason to stay home. Grab your tickets before they disappear! ****
 
******************************** SCAM ALERT -- IMPORTANT TICKET INFORMATION
 
